{"t":"Monks","s":"monks-fc524","k":"outro","i":"assets/wiki/Dark_Monk_91a9d4.gif","q":1,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><p>Monks are monastic by definition. \"Good\" monks value life, nature, health, and information. They spend most of their time studying to better themselves, and to find ways to better mankind.\n</p><p>\"Bad\" monks are very dark by nature. They are just as studious as good monks, but they focus their studies on domination, mind control, and the dark arts.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Monks\">Monks</span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable sortable full-width\" style=\"text-align:center;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Name\n</th>\n<th data-sort-type=\"number\">Exp\n</th>\n<th data-sort-type=\"number\">HP\n</th>\n<th data-sort-type=\"number\">Loot\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Dark%20Monk\"><img alt=\"Dark Monk\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Dark_Monk_91a9d4.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></span><br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Dark%20Monk\">Dark Monk</a>\n</td>\n<td class=\"numeric\">145\n</td>\n<td class=\"numeric\">190\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:left;\"><div class=\"loot-table\" id=\"w-loot_perc_loot\">\n<ul><li>0-18× <a href=\"#/wiki/Gold%20Coin\">Gold Coin</a> (uncommon)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Bread\">Bread</a> (uncommon)</li>\n<li>Dark Rosary (uncommon)</li>\n<li>Rope Belt (uncommon)</li>\n<li>Scroll (semi-rare)</li>\n<li>Book of Prayers (semi-rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Mana%20Potion\">Mana Potion</a> (rare)</li>\n<li>Lamp (rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Life%20Crystal\">Life Crystal</a> (rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Ankh\">Ankh</a> (rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Sandals\">Sandals</a> (rare)</li>\n<li>Safety Pin (rare)</li>\n<li>Brown Flask (very rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Power%20Ring\">Power Ring</a> (very rare)</li